e_name": "Pythagoras_02.png", "id": "1521857538609718", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402154_1521857545276384_6932935515601424484_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iZifqgh75UEQ7kNvwGs99I_&_nc_oc=Adpj0uA7bBCs6LqKCzrISXzFnQCcFuv2eq37LUblnrDia3JP_YUByZhlcInomgj2cvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHKeAus1ITRQ2ukYm1i3ttuf5YfKzej6xj1er26yUn4w&oe=6AFB239C"}, {"file_name": "Levy_02.png", "id": "196149426884252", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997710_196149430217585_1332548403471429223_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YZsoMqEuCroQ7kNvwHqeuOq&_nc_oc=AdosU8JgDlk0WYRRI3uCnNuNUeCc6UWFcN-rnXjiGkWAQD1VlN9Bp2GLXeLeVfSi-LA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSlcdH3Hd69vK-SN91p_vYmosZusW4ZQpXEMd25yhsuA&oe=6AFB4A9B"}, {"file_name": "Radial_Solid.png", "id": "271501478838543", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031373_271501482171876_8031340628965781426_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qvMJIL_uoAMQ7kNvwFm93lq&_nc_oc=AdrxNKac-Y3ZrfXlEOBsTYE6NOXuRlJYhSZiR49eD71epL5Rent9_VNIf_NHYRLcMmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTMpy9i0Rt3sWtUkhBQwKE28l4F5ahoMs8a1-qRAUFYCg&oe=6AFB44DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Psydmind_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1020482742612505", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982514_1020482745945838_6452784102981224285_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KUmUzyyUx7gQ7kNvwE9i1Ix&_nc_oc=AdpvVT1PrSZZrd8k2Omh9KSuRhp2ZgQfg0w_Js8tgIZuQCs31NgqGY9vTmKY6O-x4VY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4EQElunRMIV4ej-ulQmsROPLe-HeQk9AOCvtHc65xng&oe=6AFB241B"}, "display_name": "VoctoR PsydMind", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\n\nPsydMind offers a powerful approach to meditation: \nFive distinct categories: Each scene is designed to address a specific mental health concern, incorporating elements of color theory, math, and shape theory to optimize your experience.\nGenerative art: Witness the mesmerizing beauty of evolving fractal landscapes, created through generative art, adding a dynamic and captivating element to your meditation practice.\nObject movement with binaural beats: Harmonize your brainwaves with the gentle movement of objects and the soothing sounds of binaural beats, promoting a deeper state of relaxation and focus.\n\nData collection and analysis: Gain insights into your progress and identify areas for improvement through anonymous data collection and analysis.\nBinaural beats: Incorporating beats with the moving objects could further promote relaxation and focus, aligning with the user's desired mental state.\nMusic: Carefully selected music can complement the visuals and binaural beats, creating a harmonious and immersive experience.\n\nAreas for further exploration:\nCustomizable parameters: Consider allowing users to adjust the parameters of the fractal drawings, binaural beats, and music to personalize their experience.\nIntegration with other tools: Investigate potential integration with other wellness apps or wearable devices to offer a more holistic approach to mental", "short_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\nCombining the five categories of scenes (anxiety, stress, ADHD, insomnia, and depression) with design principles like fractal drawing using generative art sounds like a powerful and creative approach. Objects moving with binaural beats and music further enhances the immersive and therapeutic experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p